# shawndo site env for glm-v53-flash-nvfp4-4x-noswitch (stock nvidia NVFP4, zero weight mods).
# Bring-up copies this file to upstream/.env on the head (spark-0f0b) — upstream's .gitignore
# ignores .env, so the node tree stays pristine. Based on upstream .env.switchless.example
# @ pin 770d115. Values sourced from the FP8 4x-noswitch recipe's committed site config.

# start.sh runs ON the head; rank 0 = local. Aliases resolve from spark-0f0b's SSH mesh.
HOSTS="local spark-6d14.shawndo.intra spark-6d90.shawndo.intra spark-6d24.shawndo.intra"
SSH_OPTS="-o BatchMode=yes"
# Management LAN, rank order 0..3 (same as the FP8 recipe's cluster map).
IPS="10.69.42.170 10.69.42.171 10.69.42.172 10.69.42.173"
# Bootstrap/mgmt interface for the launcher's socket env (NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME,
# GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME, MN_IF_NAME, TP_SOCKET_IFNAME): must reach ALL ranks — the mgmt
# NIC enP7s7 (10.69.42.0/16), same value the FP8 launcher uses. NOT a fabric PF:
# enp1s0f0np0 etc. live on per-link /24s and can only reach that link's single peer.
FABRIC_IFACE=enP7s7
# STAGED BRING-UP (research.md changelog 2026-10-09): first boot runs the site's proven
# 2-PF-per-node fabric (netplan addresses only enp1s0f0np0/enp1s0f1np1). The four-PF
# contract (all four PF names below) returns in the Phase-E upgrade, after the othexmr
# four-PF NCCL is rebuilt against this site's addressing.
# IB_HCA=rocep1s0f0,rocep1s0f1,roceP2p1s0f0,roceP2p1s0f1
IB_HCA=rocep1s0f0,rocep1s0f1
# Existing site NCCL rebuild (2.30.7-1 sm_121, research.md §2.2 of the FP8 recipe).
# bring-up step 1 decides: contract-pass → keep; contract-fail → build othexmr four-PF
# (feat/four-pf-source-integration @ 94c2669) against the site addressing below.
NCCL_HOST_DIR="$HOME/.local/lib/nccl-patched"
SWITCHLESS_NCCL_SHA256=afe5f48626284eae89988516e450c7f20cc303904ba4b7083b88aa3ca1e9b85f
# Site ring: 4 QSFP56 cables × 2 PFs each = 8 logical /24 links (FP8 recipe used only 4).
# 10.10.0.0/21 covers 10.10.0.x–10.10.7.x; final per-link addressing is a bring-up task
# (extend the FP8 netplan plan). NOTE: upstream's four-PF build was validated on
# 10.100.224.0/22 — different addressing needs a validated compatible build
# (docs/switchless.md); this is bring-up's highest-risk item.
SWITCHLESS_ADDR_RANGE=10.10.0.0/21
SWITCHLESS_SUBNET_PREFIX_LEN=24
TRANSPORT=switchless
# Built from Dockerfile.roce on every node per upstream docs/install.md (minutes, no CUDA compile).
IMAGE=glm53-roce:v11-b58f34ea
# Materialized real directories (hardlinks into the HF cache blobs — zero copy, zero
# weight modification). Created by ../site/materialize-weights.sh on every node.
MODEL_DIR="$HOME/.local/nvfp4-tp4/weights/nvidia-glm53-nvfp4"
DRAFT_DIR="$HOME/.local/nvfp4-tp4/weights/glm53-dflash2"
CTN=glm53-nvfp4
OVERLAY_REMOTE="$HOME/.local/nvfp4-tp4"
# Site-added zero-mod profile (committed at upstream/profiles/stock-nvfp4.env).
source profiles/stock-nvfp4.env
